abstract: >-
  Mindful is a reproducible and extensible framework for
  medical imaging AI, supporting classification and
  segmentation tasks with JSON-configurable experiments and
  cross-validation-based evaluation. Mindful-subream extends
  this framework by adding the multimodal capabilities
  developed in the SUBREAM and Lesion Lens projects.
